  "title": "Classic Tiramisu",
  "description": "This tiramisu recipe gently cooks egg yolks and whips them with creamy mascarpone; spread over coffee liqueur-soaked ladyfingers and top with cocoa and chocolate curls.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
